sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant SearchSvc as Location Search Service
    participant BizSvc as Business Profile Service
    participant RedisGeohash as Redis (Geohash)
    participant RedisCache as Redis (Profile)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Kafka as Message Queue
    participant Worker as Index Worker

    %% Read Path (Search)
    Client->>GW: GET /search/nearby?lat,lng,radius
    GW->>SearchSvc: Forward Search Request
    SearchSvc->>SearchSvc: Calculate Geohash & 8 Neighbors
    SearchSvc->>RedisGeohash: MGET business_ids for 9 Geohashes
    RedisGeohash-->>SearchSvc: Return List of business_ids
    SearchSvc->>RedisCache: MGET Profiles for business_ids
    RedisCache-->>SearchSvc: Return Business Profiles
    SearchSvc->>SearchSvc: Filter exact distance, Sort, Apply category/rating filters
    SearchSvc-->>GW: Return Top N Results
    GW-->>Client: Return Search Results

    %% Write Path (Business Profile Update)
    Client->>GW: POST /businesses (Update Profile)
    GW->>BizSvc: Forward Update Request
    BizSvc->>DB: Update Business Profile
    DB-->>BizSvc: Success
    BizSvc-->>GW: Return Success
    GW-->>Client: Return Success
    BizSvc->>Kafka: Publish Update Event (CDC / Event)
    
    %% Async Index Update
    Kafka->>Worker: Consume Update Event
    Worker->>RedisGeohash: Update Geohash sets
    Worker->>RedisCache: Invalidate / Update Profile Hash
